wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">A coquettish fascinator.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/17/A_coquettish_fascinator..png/revision/latest?cb=20210211202639\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"A coquettish fascinator.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/17/A_coquettish_fascinator..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210211202639\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/17/A_coquettish_fascinator..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210211202639 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/17/A_coquettish_fascinator..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210211202639 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"A coquettish fascinator.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"A_coquettish_fascinator..png\" data-image-name=\"A coquettish fascinator..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_7\" title=\"Series 7\">7</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Acaster\" title=\"James Acaster\">James Acaster</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lotta_soup.\" title=\"Lotta soup.\">Lotta soup.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_perfect_stuff.\" title=\"The perfect stuff.\">The perfect stuff.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>A coquettish fascinator.</b></i> is the sixth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_7\" title=\"Series 7\">Series 7</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 10 October 2018. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/James_Acaster\" title=\"James Acaster\">James Acaster</a>.\n</p><p>This episode marks the first fifty episode milestone of the UK show.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_coquettish_fascinator.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"A little coquettish fascinator\" was how <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> described the silver bowl that <a href=\"/wiki/Kerry_Godliman\" title=\"Kerry Godliman\">Kerry Godliman</a> had put on her portrait of him, during the <a href=\"/wiki/Put_exactly_50_different_things_in_this_bin\" title=\"Put exactly 50 different things in this bin\">Put exactly 50 different things in this bin</a> task. The title card depicts a cake with candles reading \"50\", referencing this episode's status as the show's 50th episode.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_coquettish_fascinator.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'En koket pyntehat', which translates as 'A coquettish decorative hat'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Keimaileva hattu', which translates as 'A coquettish hat'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'En kokett hodepryd', which translates as 'A coquettish headpiece'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_coquettish_fascinator.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/James_Acaster\" title=\"James Acaster\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">James Acaster</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jessica_Knappett\" title=\"Jessica Knappett\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jessica Knappett</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Kerry_Godliman\" title=\"Kerry Godliman\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Kerry Godliman</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Wang\" title=\"Phil Wang\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Phil Wang</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rhod_Gilbert\" title=\"Rhod Gilbert\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rhod Gilbert</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_key\" title=\"Best key\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best key.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Put_exactly_50_different_things_in_this_bin\" title=\"Put exactly 50 different things in this bin\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Put exactly 50 different things in this bin.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Using all the items on this mat, make the best picture of the Taskmaster.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Write_and_perform_the_most_suspenseful_soap_opera_cliff-hanger\" title=\"Write and perform the most suspenseful soap opera cliff-hanger\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Write and perform the most suspenseful soap opera cliff-hanger. Your scene may last no more than one minute.\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Put_all_the_pairs_of_glasses_into_the_smallest_of_these_boxes\" title=\"Put all the pairs of glasses into the smallest of these boxes\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>In the lab, there are 10 pairs of glasses. The pairs of glasses may not leave the lab. Without breaking any of the pairs of glasses, put all the pairs of glasses into the smallest of these boxes. You must select your box before leaving the caravan, and may not then change your mind.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_your_doughnut_as_high_as_possible\" title=\"Get your doughnut as high as possible\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Get your doughnut as high as possible. You must be holding hands with the people on either side of you at all times. If your doughnut is in the air after the 100 seconds, its height will be measured from where it lands.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">19\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_coquettish_fascinator.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Video\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><small><i>Video unavailable in some regions. Find an alternati